! Illustrative 100 m2, one-zone box with a 12 m2 south-facing window.
! Constant 6 W/m2 gains, 0.3 ACH infiltration, 20/26 C ideal sensible loads.
! Fixed adiabatic floor; no humidity controls, plant sizing, or HVAC efficiency.
! Six timesteps per hour; report weather and energy hourly and annually.
! The runner replaces @YEAR@ with the EPW actual year before simulation.
! This fixture checks weather consumption; it is not a calibrated building.

